orroborating identity evidence; the official HTTPS college profile and HTTPS catalogue pages are the website and programme evidence.","The managed proxy produced the exact self-signed certificate-chain error on the first normal TLS request; curl --insecure was used only for public GETs to confirmed official/search hosts. Search-engine results were used for discovery only, not as verification evidence."]}